<h2 class="g-h2" id="the-signal">The signal and Why?</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p>The page's signal is the most serious of its appeal and later-court treatments (the same rule as <code>worstSignal</code>). <em>Why?</em> opens a small dialog naming the treatment that sets it, the court, the passage, and a link to its row; the header's flag gives the same reason. Both are built in <code>partials/opinion-page.njk</code> from <code>opinion.status</code>.</p></div>
