<h2 class="g-h2" id="behaviour">Behaviour</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p>The panel follows the tab: this summary on Opinion, <a href="/lists/narrow-by/">Narrow by</a> on the two lists, the signal key on History, each with a way back to the summary. On narrow screens the panel is a drawer (<code>app_shell.js</code>).</p></div>

